        },
        {
          "source": "https://consensys.io/blog/consensys-raises-450m-series-d-funding",
          "thread": "Lubin governance legitimacy",
          "why": "The former-employee lawsuit alleging Lubin stripped equity by transferring assets including MetaMask to a new entity hit hard because it reframes Consensys' whole decentralization narrative as potentially self-serving restructuring."
