          "source": "https://coinmarketcap.com/academy/article/consensys-delays-ethereum-ipo-2026",
          "thread": "IPO and institutional pivot",
          "why": "Tapping JPMorgan and Goldman while delaying for market conditions signals Consensys is positioning for a traditional finance exit, which readers read as a test of whether Web3 infrastructure can stay independent post-liquidity event."
