          "source": "https://consensys.io/blog/consensys-launches-linea-mainnet-unlocking-a-new-level-of-user-experience",
          "thread": "Linea L2 ecosystem buildout",
          "why": "Linea's MetaDEX launch, ENS partnership, and Discord hack put Consensys' own L2 under scrutiny as both a growth vector and a centralization risk given who controls the sequencer."
